		*m: setvfrmworkorder		&& Set Visiblity for frmWorkOrder Screens
		*m: setwodescript		&& Pass Start or Finish
		*m: set_frmchoosewo		&& Set_frmChooseWO was once named WOscreen
		*m: set_frmworkorder		&& Enable or Disable the WorkOrder form
		*m: set_frmworkorder_descript
		*m: showgantt
		*m: showgfmlog		&& *
		*m: showposcreen
		*m: showswage_log
		*m: showwire_log
		*m: show_frmchoosewo_detail_color
		*m: show_frmchoosewo_wodetail
		*m: show_frmstockused
		*m: show_frmstock_produced		&& Show Stock produced by WO_Detail
		*m: show_frmworkorder_markedstock
		*m: show_frmworkorder_wodetail
		*m: show_stocklst
		*m: stocklstadd_wod		&& Add with WOD Details
		*m: stocklst_process_custom_save
		*m: stocklst_process_remove_custom
		*m: tmpspcmpltp
		*m: totalfinishweight
		*m: updatewodetail_proj		&& Have new  ID for WOD
		*m: workorderscreen
		*m: wo_poitem
		*p: aforms
		*p: cc
		*p: cl
		*p: clocatefor		&& Used by ImportWordOrder and Find buttons.
		*p: co_id
		*p: cwhat2
		*p: fcc
		*p: fcl
		*p: init_import
		*p: itemnumber		&& Used in frmPO
		*p: nconnhandle
		*p: ncontactid
		*p: nid_detail_process
		*p: nstock_projected_id
		*p: nwo
		*p: pwhat
		*p: salesnum		&& Used in frmPO
		*p: selectwo
		*p: soitemtot		&& Used in frmPO
		*p: vendcode
		*p: woonpoitem
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

